{"id": "draft-c23-02", "record_sha256": "d9ebde684e3a94229bf80c58b23145c42b002118708829cda963dbe86bb52e08", "math_sha256": "07d55c1b08c1c970e96bde227d5e84338ec3d0e8f3789632807cb73ae8497a0e", "problem": "证明:若 $A$ 为正交矩阵,则等距变换 $T(x)=Ax+b$ 保持任意两点间的距离,即 $\\|T(x)-T(y)\\|=\\|x-y\\|$。"}
{"id": "draft-c23-03", "record_sha256": "befe1c61b6a0498555122bdd468538d3a8d5c9b292c748d8d7ee2d6565653360", "math_sha256": "59f561330f9b4ab456e40aec0d9aadc0a7f6abbb01a6169a47d25690074dc530", "problem": "分析等距变换$T(x,y,z)=(x+2,4-y,z)$：说明其几何类型，求固定点集合、逆变换及$T^2$，并证明它保持距离。"}
{"id": "draft-c23-04", "record_sha256": "13a8bb104f2ed51183de618afda475a0caaf69a2899f1efd93e39a2338e6a671", "math_sha256": "9c990871e2514c56fea83ac69f183c8ee7ef503895e4dd1b1750117737b8346e", "problem": "取单位法向量$n=(2,-1,2)/3$，两平面$n\\cdot x=1$、$n\\cdot x=5/2$。求先关于前者、再关于后者反射的复合，说明逆序、固定点和两平面间距。"}
{"id": "draft-c23-05", "record_sha256": "6bd033dc38a59fa889bc4218d4b7944c912276e9269117810eb2859f1880806e", "math_sha256": "ed42c27e47eb591653e6b261fd7ed14dbe89b5d086196667618f605466e39237", "problem": "把等距变换 $T(x)=Ax+b$ 分解为绕某轴的旋转与沿该轴平移的复合(螺旋运动),其中 $A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1&0\\\\1&0&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$(绕 $z$ 轴旋转 $90^\\circ$),$b=(1,2,3)$。"}
{"id": "draft-c24-01", "record_sha256": "0905ef733b9e22ba81243a88c26ec3186585ea2658ac87d1cabc1bfe81caa3c4", "math_sha256": "29b7f518642991476524b3d1a72efb565d9470f82a7d2acbcb2592eeb2827c7f", "problem": "解释剪切变换 $\\begin{cases}x'=x+2y\\\\ y'=y\\end{cases}$ 对单位正方形 $[0,1]\\times[0,1]$ 的几何作用，并求像的面积。"}
{"id": "draft-c24-02", "record_sha256": "412831cbe61695b7eebbc8c10820d4f91a835264e66a2a6b698f4bea81963db7", "math_sha256": "6cb60121042b58324aaa8bc8097c8245451bf78834364e13a4f602d373292bb2", "problem": "仿射映射$T(x,y)=(1+x+y,-1+2x+2y)$作用于单位圆$x^2+y^2=1$。求完整像集和每个像点在圆上的原像数，说明为什么不能使用可逆仿射的椭圆结论。"}
{"id": "draft-c24-03", "record_sha256": "e1dd86987ebda33d1218780b3724203392ce7749c151d1850e5e95fdc11b1477", "math_sha256": "024855f49cef5096b3912559393a1e87847a8132d1f17ebfb30188e4a19e626c", "problem": "设$T_t(x)=A_tx+b$，$A_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1&2\\\\t&t^2\\end{pmatrix}$，$t\\in\\mathbb R$。求可逆参数及逆矩阵，并在每个奇异参数下给整个平面像、相容条件与全部纤维。"}
{"id": "draft-c24-04", "record_sha256": "10f13e92a6ed5395413b6952a274eb6cbca63155f475a4d5c3fdf30ba02269aa", "math_sha256": "811d5dcea38ff7e9f1c0371722994910c8b2284380e79579ea242e4a0dfa929d", "problem": "未知仿射映射将$(0,0),(1,0),(0,1)$依次映到$(1,-1),(3,0),(0,2)$。求映射、原三角形的像面积与像重心，以及直线$x+y=1$的像方程。"}
{"id": "draft-c24-05", "record_sha256": "535ce41612c402fa43fca78472badf65b78e01339d99dafc312dca2eba5780e5", "math_sha256": "e4599a7b1a32956d13f0f15094f1147cb7e9549bb371915ed5eabac9afb9a8b0", "problem": "证明可逆仿射变换 $T(x)=Ax+b$ 把直线映成直线、把平行直线映成平行直线、保持共线三点的简单比，并说明圆在一般仿射变换下为何变成椭圆。"}
{"id": "draft-c25-01", "record_sha256": "7bdb9cfb65e8b954d03a391a63889983c4716af553dd9a4ffbce323ab4021b37", "math_sha256": "c8ea92b17e50596876340d8ee9be21863f4f576f8d48b623bb5a7a74f01c7b4d", "problem": "分类圆锥$x^2+y^2=z^2$与过顶点平面$z=ax$（$a\\in\\mathbb R$）的实交集，并给所有非单点分支的完整参数式。"}
{"id": "draft-c25-02", "record_sha256": "02775ff1504e0a608ef5c52cffa68345759576d8876003e2709082dc2024d98d", "math_sha256": "506e8d9d0e238b5af3b602c25501afb8705bd4289ed775bbef63c0df06bb82ab", "problem": "求两圆柱面 $x^2+y^2=1$ 与 $y^2+z^2=1$ 的交线的参数方程，并说明交线由几支组成、在何处相接。"}
{"id": "draft-c25-03", "record_sha256": "06275899949f43493cbdd9dce376e8ec3e42005101150eb0f2250ed4c73233d4", "math_sha256": "54f74831155da08a75d063ddb5d38039d1d8f8e28dee101a5743c3958a0f88da", "problem": "求圆锥面 $x^2+y^2=z^2$ 与平面 $z=1+y$ 的交线的参数方程，并判断该交线是什么曲线。"}
{"id": "draft-c25-04", "record_sha256": "bd51573b224b833cd2e1780bc2664f24d386aac5e40e31e5e01e3358627d13e9", "math_sha256": "618e736e47696725cd7ba21f7fa8f91e050eafdb32653fccf136718193548648", "problem": "求柱面$x^2+y^2=4$与$z=x^2$的完整交线参数式，并证明交线不包含于任何平面。"}
{"id": "draft-c25-05", "record_sha256": "1ae8b749bde76269433d8817e3c575cd65b01796218881225dce6f9e5e6bf09a", "math_sha256": "647daa4f7111d9d84ee6ac7aa71a26d04aefeed186b8e6f44b7ded922ffae66e", "problem": "求球$x^2+y^2+z^2=1$与抛物柱面$y=x^2$的实交线，给参数域、分支连接关系，证明交线正则且非平面。"}
{"id": "draft-c26-01", "record_sha256": "e4958c415d9bdd85dc46090cd31565345d93333188be53f8334119bc1eaaa70e", "math_sha256": "6d1ac85b70ef7fe07a7064e6065c8856f4ecc16a20c7bc208cf70fefc0100680", "problem": "令$n=(1,2,-1)$、$d=(1,1,0)$，定义$P(x)=x-(n\\cdot x)d/3$。求矩阵、核与像，证明其为沿$d$投影到$n\\cdot x=0$的斜投影，判断是否为Euclidean正交投影。"}
{"id": "draft-c26-02", "record_sha256": "a5c82e5177526bf955f2e0ff331018081f1cb00a6935cc5a3fcedbccc9c3d6a2", "math_sha256": "abbd296242c4faa319d3a094059dc900e39e77e3b4df78ae8b3799e49c251676", "problem": "分类所有保持两条坐标轴各自不变、并将单位圆映到自身的实线性映射$A:\\mathbb R^2\\to\\mathbb R^2$。分别给其固定点集合与定向。"}
{"id": "draft-c26-03", "record_sha256": "3fdfb579c3bf218488a75c008dd2d58901f87ab10969a79fd4e3e4f1555f6e37", "math_sha256": "5e943db0ed712ed88da58f2b39eb5be244492dcb606cbd653e2ddbc3b1e8cb11", "problem": "对$A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&2\\\\0&-1\\end{pmatrix}$，证明$A^2=I$，求固定线与变号线，判断是否为Euclidean反射。说明线性对合为何不一定是等距变换。"}
{"id": "draft-c26-04", "record_sha256": "2c247e5f0a5729041ccb4fa2084f14e0e36cc65489c7500b700c0aa1748ad617", "math_sha256": "3c20767c365236c22d3bb8bfe8e88d9aa0201dccd0af65444dd7ee8ef8d3ae04", "problem": "在$\\mathbb R^4$中比较$T(x)=(x_3,x_4,0,0)$与$U(x)=(x_2,x_3,0,0)$。求迭代像维数与最小归零次数，证明它们虽秩相同却不相似，并判断可否对角化。"}
{"id": "draft-c26-05", "record_sha256": "ba688df7b049d9d9683d03c718dea49dd0eb4b7e89a2e5c4c1583a1f80f2c591", "math_sha256": "a3dc4380de79779dd86cb8cb360fa53cd72545d6d684666558c3c2ca4fe1d9ba", "problem": "设 $A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1\\\\1&0\\end{pmatrix}$(旋转 $90^\\circ$),$B=\\begin{pmatrix}2&0\\\\0&1\\end{pmatrix}$(沿 $x$ 方向伸缩)。计算 $AB$ 与 $BA$，并用单位正方形的像说明两者对应的几何作用不同。"}
{"id": "draft-c27-01", "record_sha256": "93109f0039ded5fc20091850b6dc8bda19ebaf4c70bcd9fb0437221d5a80e031", "math_sha256": "29ef73daa2f671f2820da7423b4107e3d0d8ae668d4d396d9f69728c1d03756c", "problem": "设$n\\ge2$、$u,v\\in\\mathbb R^n$均非零，$A=I+uv^{\\mathsf T}$。用$\\alpha=v^{\\mathsf T}u$分类其可对角化性并求最小多项式；必须处理$\\alpha=0$而$uv^{\\mathsf T}\\ne0$的情况。"}
{"id": "draft-c27-02", "record_sha256": "1f3ddfd849967c728286ff398ab7b333bd9f41977f8a27d27652e99f18c54364", "math_sha256": "1e2cb9b33490c9f5bfde07d8f562d636517933e3e568396a92d86821344c9a3b", "problem": "求实矩阵$A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\\\2&1&1\\end{pmatrix}$在$\\mathbb C$上的对角化，并判断它能否在$\\mathbb R$上对角化。"}
{"id": "draft-c27-03", "record_sha256": "6867068f6a8f954c7495ea4f0b8f3459c8b3f14e1ada073101ecdfcfeb5bf700", "math_sha256": "e23b70a1ba26539b6f66210b3fe4be1f123734bae95bbd4b1e8dd2d9be608587", "problem": "设实矩阵$A$满足$A^3=A$。不用先求坐标特征向量，构造对应特征值$0,1,-1$的谱投影，证明$A$可对角化，并给所有正整数幂。"}
